  {
    "id": "8aece2c420542fb575e7",
    "source": "Take it as a bonus action: Cunning Action, Fast Hands, Expeditious Retreat or a monk's ki. Cunning Action: Dash, Disengage or Hide (with the action already spent, it is used by itself); Expeditious Retreat: Dash (the casting's own Dash too, on the turn it is cast); Fast Hands: Use an Object; monk's ki: Dash, Disengage or Dodge (Step of the Wind, Patient Defense; the server spends 1 ki).",
    "sourceHash": "8aece2c420542fb575e73790ebe187de110354d75135851d8b888c35d9248be8",
