    "id": "675b0c4ab7aece309589",
    "source": "Take your active character's next level, as the level-up dialog does: read odm_level_up_options first and send its nextLevel with the picks it lists. The server builds the level from these choices alone (hit points by the table's method, features, slots) and refuses an unearned level or an illegal pick with the reason. A pick left out stays owed for the next level-up. The answer is the new sheet with hpGained.",
